-one-liner-safe-form.md\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-08-13-handoff-pr15-component-aware-review-provenance.md\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-08-15-decision-log-self-referential-policy-template-contamination.md\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-09-24-handoff-multirepo-review-continuation.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
